          "description": "Fetch data from a Massive.com REST API endpoint. Use a path from search_endpoints results. Set store_as to save results as an in-memory table for SQL querying with query_data. Paginated responses include a next-page hint with the exact path and params for the follow-up request. The apply parameter runs built-in functions on results — string input values refer to table columns, numeric values are literals. Use search_endpoints with scope=\"functions\" to discover available functions.",
